  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for He-M 513) #4495, eff 9-23-88; EXPIRED: 9-23-94 New. #6155, eff 12-29-95; ss by #8016, eff 12-29-03; ss by #10030, eff 12-1-11, EXPIRED: 12-1-19 New. #12944, INTERIM, eff 12-20-19, EXPIRED: 6-17-20 New. #13263, eff 9-22-21",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
